  "1 Uncommon, 1 Rare, from the colorless pool. {pct}% price markup.": { eng: "1 Uncommon, 1 Rare, from the colorless pool. {pct}% price markup.", deu: "1 Ungewöhnliche, 1 Seltene aus dem farblosen Pool. {pct}% Preisaufschlag.", esp: "1 Infrecuente, 1 Rara, de la reserva incolora. Recargo del {pct}% en el precio.", fra: "1 Peu commune, 1 Rare, issues du pool incolore. Majoration de {pct}% sur le prix.", ita: "1 Non comune, 1 Rara, dal pool incolore. Prezzo maggiorato del {pct}%.", jpn: "無色プールからアンコモン1枚、レア1枚。価格は{pct}%割増。", kor: "무색 풀에서 고급 1장, 희귀 1장. 가격 {pct}% 할증.", pol: "1 Niepospolita, 1 Rzadka z puli bezbarwnej. Cena wyższa o {pct}%.", ptb: "1 Incomum, 1 Rara, do conjunto incolor. Acréscimo de {pct}% no preço.", rus: "1 необычная, 1 редкая из бесцветного пула. Наценка {pct}%.", spa: "1 Infrecuente, 1 Rara, de la reserva incolora. Recargo del {pct}% en el precio.", tha: "อันคอมมอน 1 ใบ แรร์ 1 ใบ จากพูลไร้สี ราคาบวกเพิ่ม {pct}%", tur: "Renksiz havuzdan 1 Sıradışı, 1 Nadir. Fiyata %{pct} ek ücret.", zhs: "来自无色卡池：1张罕见、1张稀有。价格上浮{pct}%。", zht: "來自無色卡池：1張罕見、1張稀有。價格上浮{pct}%。" },
  "2 random rarity rolls + 1 guaranteed Shop relic. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat, and Amethyst Aubergine are blacklisted (gold-generating relics removed in Major Update #1).": { eng: "2 random rarity rolls + 1 guaranteed Shop relic. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat, and Amethyst Aubergine are blacklisted (gold-generating relics removed in Major Update #1).", deu: "2 zufällige Seltenheitswürfe + 1 garantiertes Laden-Relikt. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat und Amethyst Aubergine sind ausgeschlossen (goldgenerierende Relikte, mit Major Update #1 entfernt).", esp: "2 tiradas de rareza aleatorias + 1 reliquia de Tienda garantizada. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat y Amethyst Aubergine están excluidas (reliquias que generan oro, eliminadas en la Actualización mayor #1).", fra: "2 tirages de rareté aléatoires + 1 relique de Boutique garantie. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat et Amethyst Aubergine sont exclues (reliques générant de l'or, retirées dans la Mise à jour majeure #1).", ita: "2 estrazioni di rarità casuali + 1 reliquia da Negozio garantita. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat e Amethyst Aubergine sono escluse (reliquie che generano oro, rimosse nel Major Update #1).", jpn: "ランダムなレアリティ抽選2回＋ショップレリック1個確定。The Courier、Old Coin、Lucky Fysh、Bowler Hat、Amethyst Aubergine は除外されています（ゴールドを生むレリックは Major Update #1 で削除）。", kor: "무작위 희귀도 2회 + 상점 유물 1개 확정. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat, Amethyst Aubergine은 제외됩니다(골드 생성 유물은 Major Update #1에서 제거).", pol: "2 losowe rzuty rzadkości + 1 gwarantowany relikt Sklepowy. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat i Amethyst Aubergine są wykluczone (relikty generujące złoto, usunięte w Major Update #1).", ptb: "2 sorteios de raridade aleatórios + 1 relíquia de Loja garantida. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat e Amethyst Aubergine estão na lista negra (relíquias geradoras de ouro removidas na Atualização principal #1).", rus: "2 случайных броска редкости + 1 гарантированная магазинная реликвия. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat и Amethyst Aubergine исключены (реликвии, дающие золото, убраны в Major Update #1).", spa: "2 tiradas de rareza aleatorias + 1 reliquia de Tienda garantizada. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat y Amethyst Aubergine están excluidas (reliquias que generan oro, eliminadas en la Actualización mayor #1).", tha: "สุ่มความหายาก 2 ครั้ง + เรลิกร้านค้าการันตี 1 ชิ้น The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat และ Amethyst Aubergine ถูกตัดออก (เรลิกสร้างทองถูกลบใน Major Update #1)", tur: "2 rastgele nadirlik çekilişi + 1 garanti Dükkân kalıntısı. The Courier, Old Coin, Lucky Fysh, Bowler Hat ve Amethyst Aubergine kara listededir (altın üreten kalıntılar Major Update #1 ile kaldırıldı).", zhs: "2次随机稀有度抽取 + 1个必定的商店遗物。The Courier、Old Coin、Lucky Fysh、Bowler Hat 和 Amethyst Aubergine 被排除（产金遗物已在 Major Update #1 中移除）。", zht: "2次隨機稀有度抽取 + 1個必定的商店遺物。The Courier、Old Coin、Lucky Fysh、Bowler Hat 和 Amethyst Aubergine 被排除（產金遺物已在 Major Update #1 中移除）。" },
  "3 random potions from the available pool.": { eng: "3 random potions from the available pool.", deu: "3 zufällige Tränke aus dem verfügbaren Pool.", esp: "3 pociones aleatorias de la reserva disponible.", fra: "3 potions aléatoires issues du pool disponible.", ita: "3 pozioni casuali dal pool disponibile.", jpn: "利用可能なプールからランダムなポーション3個。", kor: "사용 가능한 풀에서 무작위 물약 3개.", pol: "3 losowe mikstury z dostępnej puli.", ptb: "3 poções aleatórias do conjunto disponível.", rus: "3 случайных зелья из доступного пула.", spa: "3 pociones aleatorias de la reserva disponible.", tha: "โพชั่นสุ่ม 3 ขวดจากพูลที่มี", tur: "Mevcut havuzdan 3 rastgele iksir.", zhs: "从可用池中随机抽取3瓶药水。", zht: "從可用池中隨機抽取3瓶藥水。" },
